Volume:
 
Get-PSDrive 								         - Only Drives  ( C: D: HKLM: ENV: etc )
Get-PSDrive -PSProvider FileSystem | Select-Object -ExpandProperty Name          - clean list of drive letters only
Get-PSDrive -PSProvider FileSystem                                               - list all Drives with volume stats
Get-WmiObject Win32_LogicalDisk				                         - List detailed OS-level info about logical disks (partitions, drives, removable storage,network drives, etc.) using WMI ie winmgmt

---------------

fsutil fsinfo drives	                                                         - Lists all drives on the system
fsutil fsinfo drivetype <drive>	                                                 - Displays drive type (fixed, removable, etc.)
fsutil fsinfo volumeinfo <drive>	                                         - Displays detailed info about the volume
fsutil fsinfo ntfsinfo <drive>	                                                 - Displays NTFS-specific details (sectors, clusters, MFT, etc.)
fsutil fsinfo sectorinfo <drive>	                                         - Displays sector size information

