Schedule Tasks

Get-ScheduledTask | Select-Object TaskName, TaskPath, State   -> List all Task names 


Get-ScheduledTask | Where-Object {$_.TaskName -like "*example*"}  -> To find a specific suspicious task

Get-ScheduledTask | ForEach-Object {$_ | Get-ScheduledTaskInfo}  -> detailed info (like the action it runs)


