Reg Keys

Get-ItemProperty "HKCU:\Software\Microsoft\Windows\CurrentVersion\Run"   -> (current user)

Get-ItemProperty "HKLM:\Software\Microsoft\Windows\CurrentVersion\Run"   -> (all users)

Get-ItemProperty "HKCU:\Software\Microsoft\Windows\CurrentVersion\Run" | Select-Object * | Findstr /i "auto_punch" -> search for a specific suspicious file

C:\Users\<User>\AppData\Roaming\Microsoft\Windows\Start Menu\Programs\Startup

C:\ProgramData\Microsoft\Windows\Start Menu\Programs\Startup

Get-ChildItem "C:\ProgramData\Microsoft\Windows\Start Menu\Programs\Startup"


